      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BORACAY STORM (2) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish second (23.33) at Horsham in a Grade 4/5 over 410m. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Likely to feature again. PAW MANNY (4) latest effort finished 3rd over 425m at Bendigo beaten 4.5 lengths (24.15) behind Jetstream Icon in a Special conditions Veteran race on August 14. Rates a key chance on best figures. DELATITE BEAST (5) produced a moderate run last time when seventh at this track over 450m behind Greysynd Clyde (26.21) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. The form from his last run stacks up well. Has the ability to give this a shake. SHY CABANG (8) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
